# Defense-in-depth: package.json's `files` list is the authoritative package
# allowlist, but these local-only paths must never enter an npm tarball.
AGENTS.md
CHANGELOG.md
tests/
docs/
.serena/
node_modules/

# Only the public README and license are allowed as Markdown package files.
*.md
!README.md
!LICENSE.md

# Local configuration JSON is never a package asset. npm still includes the
# required package.json metadata automatically.
*.json
